; Sotavento's water look for the game's water shader res://world/water.gdshader (only parameters):
; clear Atlantic water over white sand, so the shallows go turquoise and the deep sea dark navy blue.
; Absorption per metre: red 0.35, green 0.07, blue 0.04 (clear ocean water is nearly pure water:
; red is gone in a few metres, blue goes deep). No reflection probe (the land is low and far).

